{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gobocore Demo Version</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548780/extras/ezgif-50565e3d0d55ea.gif?t=1741735256\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your goblins trough a smaller, more limited run in the <strong>DEMO version</strong> of this\u00a0<strong>Turn-Based Auto-Battler.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo you will</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Recruit units</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Buy them equipment from selection of <strong>weapons, shields, helmets, trinkets and accessories</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You will fight against <strong>6 kinds of enemies</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Add <strong>mutations</strong> to your goblins</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Gather dungeon <strong>core mutations</strong> to unlock new items and upgrades such as recruitment camp for your run. ( These core mutations reset each run and you unlock them as you progress, making each run slightly different )</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Gain access to skill cards, that are manifested from your goblins actions - and by using them you can increase your squads survival chances.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TURN BASED BATTLE</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Your Goblins will take turns automatically and figure out their own opponents.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The turns can be set to proceed automatically or with a pause on world turn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EQUIPMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548780/extras/reroll.gif?t=1741735256\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Buy gear in home camp. And equip it to units.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gear becomes available as you progress trough the run and unlock it trough core mutations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SKILL CARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548780/extras/cards.gif?t=1741735256\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill cards are manifestations of your goblin squads hopes. <i>Skill cards are spawned by unit skills and equipment.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can use them on the battlefield to help your goblins achieve victory. Or Build your squad in a way where you don't have to use any skill cards...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill cards use Core Mana that dungeon core generates each turn.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every encounter moves time forward by a day. As time passes, the map changes, and new encounters appear.  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3548780?t=1741735256","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3548780?t=1741735256","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548780/d5e81593582c33d87e84415b79822fd8564d74d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741735256","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548780/d5e81593582c33d87e84415b79822fd8564d74d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741735256","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gobocore Demo Version</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548780/extras/ezgif-50565e3d0d55ea.gif?t=1741735256\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your goblins trough a smaller, more limited run in the <strong>DEMO version</strong> of this\u00a0<strong>Turn-Based Auto-Battler.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo you will</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Recruit units</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Buy them equipment from selection of <strong>weapons, shields, helmets, trinkets and accessories</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You will fight against <strong>6 kinds of enemies</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Add <strong>mutations</strong> to your goblins</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Gather dungeon <strong>core mutations</strong> to unlock new items and upgrades such as recruitment camp for your run. ( These core mutations reset each run and you unlock them as you progress, making each run slightly different )</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Gain access to skill cards, that are manifested from your goblins actions - and by using them you can increase your squads survival chances.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TURN BASED BATTLE</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Your Goblins will take turns automatically and figure out their own opponents.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The turns can be set to proceed automatically or with a pause on world turn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EQUIPMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548780/extras/reroll.gif?t=1741735256\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Buy gear in home camp. And equip it to units.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gear becomes available as you progress trough the run and unlock it trough core mutations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SKILL CARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548780/extras/cards.gif?t=1741735256\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill cards are manifestations of your goblin squads hopes. <i>Skill cards are spawned by unit skills and equipment.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can use them on the battlefield to help your goblins achieve victory. Or Build your squad in a way where you don't have to use any skill cards...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill cards use Core Mana that dungeon core generates each turn.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every encounter moves time forward by a day. As time passes, the map changes, and new encounters appear.  </p>","developers":["Bunkovsky"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2844440","name":"Gobocore: Goblin Rescue Squad Autobattler"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548780/edd88428756e15d22c40f1915edf0b51ddd713c4/header.jpg?t=1741735256","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101172,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101172/movie480.mp4?t=1741715964","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101172/movie_max.mp4?t=1741715964"},"name":"demo_trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101172/6710aafc878e7ec6d644e40dc3af8fbf0d763c64/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741715964","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101172/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741715964","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101172/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741715964"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257112675,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112675/movie48